    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-01: the `-e/--exclude` glob flag is documented and works correctly when passed to `hypergumbo run` (JSON output) but produces byte-identical sketch output for any glob, suggesting the sketch renderer never receives the exclude list. UAT verified with 5 glob variants. Asymmetry between `run` and sketch suggests a plumbing miss in the sketch entry point — investigate where `run` consumes excludes and verify the sketch path does the same."  # 9417
