  clock: 3  # b949
  nonce: b949  # b949
  message: "Fixed in PR #3003. Root cause: per-name fnmatch in _is_excluded_classified, FileIndex.build, and _format_structure_tree_fallback silently dropped any pattern containing '/'. Added _normalize_exclude_pattern (collapse 'ui/', 'ui/**', '**/ui/**', '**/ui' to bare 'ui'; collapse residual '**' to empty) plus a third 'path' classification bucket so patterns retaining a '/' match the relative path. Verified on alertmanager: all 5 glob variants now produce identical output (2232 nodes, 0 ui_nodes leaking) vs prior behavior where 4/5 variants produced unfiltered output (2952 nodes, 727 ui_nodes). Affects both run and sketch — UAT BUG-01 was sketch-visible because byte-identical output across 5 variants is hard to miss."  # b949
